<p>Demon horns temporarily grow on your shield as you bash a foe with it for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200%</acronym> damage.</p><p>If the attack hits the creature is impaled by the horns, causing it to bleed black blood for 50% of the damage done as darkness over 5 turns.</p><p>Any time you damage this foe in melee while it bleeds you get healed for <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>spellpower 100">91, 119, 141, 160, 176</acronym> (this can only happen once per turn).</p><p>The healing power increases with your spellpower.</p>